   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Born from the Himalayas. Worn for a Lifetime. In the Kingdom of Bhutan, the Druk — the Thunder Dragon — is more than a symbol. It is the soul of a nation: a guardian of identity, pride, and legacy that has endured for centuries across the roof of the world. This timepiece was designed by a Bhutanese artisan , channelling that same spirit into every detail. When you wear the Thunder Dragon, you carry a piece of living culture on your wrist — a story that cannot be mass-produced. Why the Thunder Dragon? Authentic cultural heritage — designed by a Bhutanese artisan, not a factory algorithm Premium Miyota GM12 movement — Japanese precision engineering for lasting accuracy Flat Sapphire crystal glass — scratch-resistant, clarity that endures 316L Stainless Steel case — surgical-grade, built to last decades 5 ATM water resistance — everyday confidence, rain or shine Slim 8.7mm profile — wears elegantly under a cuff or on its own Specifications Dial Diameter: 39mm Lug to Lug: 46mm Case Thickness: 8.7mm Case Material: 316L Stainless Steel Glass: Flat Sapphire Movement: Miyota GM12 Water Resistance: 5 ATM Available in: Navy & Mahogany Shipping & Delivery We offer free shipping within Australia and Bhutan. International shipping is $35–45 AUD , calculated at checkout based on your location. Orders are dispatched within 1–3 business days. Our Promise Every Eternal Watch is backed by our quality guarantee . If you're not completely satisfied, reach out to us — we're a small team and we stand behind every watch we send. Rated ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ by our customers.",
